# The Dockerfile installs dependencies and builds from scratch, so anything below is discarded work shipped into
# the build context — `node_modules` and `.next` alone are the bulk of this folder.
#
# ⚠️ `.env*.local` is the load-bearing line: it holds this deployment's own secrets, and `COPY . .` would bake them into
# an image layer. Runtime configuration comes from the compose file's `environment:`, never from a copied file.

node_modules/
.next/
out/
build/

.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

.git/
.vscode/
.idea/
npm-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
.DS_Store
